<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela banks and markets closed Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Venezuela banks and markets closed Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan banks and financial markets are closed Tuesday June 24 for the Battle of Carabobo national holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Wednesday June 25.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
